Modifications
-------------

This fork carries modifications made since 2026 for the 罗盘 / Compass project, a
project-management tool built on Plane. They are not part of upstream Plane, and
they are not made by, reviewed by, or supported by Plane Software, Inc.

  Date of modification: 2026-10-03

Among other changes, this fork adds:

  - a local Markdown mirror that dual-writes page and issue content to files
  - Wiki collections, folders, sub-pages, and a "move to" picker
  - a Wiki home view (recently edited pages / collection overview)
  - Markdown backfill and cleanup management commands

